  lines:
  - 'Veymar: The Veil fractures..crimson blight spills throughout.'
  - 'Veymar: Corruption devours the very veins of neon that once lit our world.'
  - "Veymar: The hordes that come are forged, reworked in the corruption\u2019s guise."
  - 'Veymar: Cleanse the crystal when the slaughter wanes, the portal shall shape
    its remnants into power.'
